From e8e69221857037d74dd4f261b041af4af0a667cb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ruelya <ujico@outlook.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 10:05:06 +0800
Subject: [patch] feat(channels): add xai_responses with Codex apply_patch
 bridge

Add channel type xai_responses (OpenAI Responses toward xAI). When the
inbound client is OpenAI Responses/Codex and the outbound channel is
xai_responses, bridge freeform custom apply_patch to function tools and
restore custom_tool_call on the response path. Disable body pass-through
while bridging so the conversion is not undone.

Plain xai (chat completions) and openai_responses routes are unchanged.
